
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Project Builder</span>
        <h1>Tell us what you're trying to accomplish.</h1>
        <p class="lead">No jargon. Three quick steps to an instant estimate.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" style="padding-top:0.5rem">
      <div class="container enquiry">

        <div>
          <form class="builder" id="builderForm" novalidate action="javascript:void(0)" method="post">
            <input type="hidden" name="type" value="project-enquiry" />
            <input type="hidden" name="page" id="pageField" value="" />
            <input type="hidden" name="category" id="categoryField" value="" />
            <input type="hidden" name="indicativePrice" id="priceField" value="" />

            <ol class="builder__progress" id="builderProgress" aria-label="Project steps">
              <li><button type="button" data-for="1" aria-label="Go to step 1: Your project"><b>1</b> Project</button></li>
              <li><button type="button" data-for="2" aria-label="Go to step 2: A few details"><b>2</b> Details</button></li>
              <li><button type="button" data-for="3" aria-label="Go to step 3: Estimate and your details"><b>3</b> Estimate</button></li>
            </ol>

            <!-- STEP 1 — what + goal -->
            <div class="builder__step" data-step="1">
              <div class="builder__head">
                <h2>What do you need?</h2>
                <p>Pick one or more. Not sure which? Choose "Something Else" — it's a normal way to start.</p>
              </div>
              <fieldset aria-describedby="catError">
                <legend class="visually-hidden">Project type</legend>
                <div class="choice-grid" id="categoryGrid">
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="Website" /><h3>Website</h3><p>For your business, service, product or personal brand.</p></label>
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="Dashboard" /><h3>Dashboard</h3><p>Turn your business data into something you can understand.</p></label>
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="Automation" /><h3>Automation</h3><p>Remove repetitive manual work and admin.</p></label>
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="AI" /><h3>AI Integration</h3><p>Add AI to an existing process, site or system.</p></label>
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="Custom Tool" /><h3>Custom Tool</h3><p>A calculator, quote tool, booking system or tracker.</p></label>
                  <label class="choice-card"><input type="checkbox" name="cat" value="Something Else" /><h3>Something Else</h3><p>Not sure yet? Describe the problem and we'll work out the solution.</p></label>
                </div>
                <p class="form__error" id="catError">Pick at least one option to continue.</p>
              </fieldset>

              <span class="builder__live" id="liveEst" hidden>Indicative <b id="liveEstPrice">—</b></span>

              <div class="builder__example" id="builderExample" hidden>
                <span class="builder__example-label">An example of the kind of thing we'd build</span>
                <div class="builder__example-cards" id="builderExampleCards"></div>
              </div>

              <div class="form-row">
                <label for="goal">In a sentence or two, what are you trying to accomplish?</label>
                <textarea id="goal" name="goal" rows="4" required aria-describedby="goalExample goalError"></textarea>
                <span class="form__hint" id="goalExample"></span>
                <span class="form__error" id="goalError">A sentence or two is plenty — tell us what you'd like to happen.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 2 — a few (optional) details -->
            <div class="builder__step" data-step="2" hidden>
              <div class="builder__head">
                <h2>A few details <span class="builder__optional">optional</span></h2>
                <p>These help us estimate more accurately, but you can skip straight to your estimate.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="qgroup" data-qgroup="Website" hidden>
                <h3>Website</h3>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">What should it do?</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="WhatsApp button" /><span>WhatsApp button</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Contact form" /><span>Contact form</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Google Maps" /><span>Google Maps</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Gallery" /><span>Gallery</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Booking" /><span>Booking</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Payments" /><span>Payments</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_features" value="Ecommerce" /><span>Ecommerce</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">Do you already have any of these?</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_have" value="Domain" /><span>A domain</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_have" value="Logo" /><span>A logo</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_have" value="Branding" /><span>Branding</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="w_have" value="Images/content" /><span>Images / content</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="qgroup" data-qgroup="Dashboard" hidden>
                <h3>Dashboard</h3>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">Where is your data now?</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="d_source" value="Excel" /><span>Excel</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="d_source" value="CSV" /><span>CSV</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="d_source" value="Database" /><span>Database</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="d_source" value="Other software" /><span>Other software</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="d_source" value="Not sure" /><span>Not sure</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row"><label for="d_show">What do you want to see on it?</label><input type="text" id="d_show" name="d_show" placeholder="e.g. Sales by month, stock levels, project progress" /></div>
              </div>

              <div class="qgroup" data-qgroup="Automation" hidden>
                <h3>Automation</h3>
                <div class="form-row"><label for="a_process">What are you doing by hand now?</label><input type="text" id="a_process" name="a_process" placeholder="e.g. Copying orders from WhatsApp into a spreadsheet" /></div>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">How often?</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="radio" name="a_often" value="Many times a day" /><span>Many times a day</span></label>
                    <label><input type="radio" name="a_often" value="Daily" /><span>Daily</span></label>
                    <label><input type="radio" name="a_often" value="Weekly" /><span>Weekly</span></label>
                    <label><input type="radio" name="a_often" value="Monthly" /><span>Monthly</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="qgroup" data-qgroup="AI" hidden>
                <h3>AI Integration</h3>
                <div class="form-row"><label for="ai_do">What would you like the AI to do?</label><input type="text" id="ai_do" name="ai_do" placeholder="e.g. Answer staff questions from our policy documents" /></div>
                <p class="form__hint">Third-party AI/API usage is billed separately based on actual usage — we explain it before building.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="qgroup" data-qgroup="Custom Tool" hidden>
                <h3>Custom Tool</h3>
                <div class="form-row"><label for="c_do">What should the tool do?</label><input type="text" id="c_do" name="c_do" placeholder="e.g. Generate quotes from a few inputs" /></div>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">Does it need any of these?</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="c_needs" value="Accounts/login" /><span>Accounts / login</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="c_needs" value="Database" /><span>A database</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="c_needs" value="Payments" /><span>Payments</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="c_needs" value="Notifications" /><span>Emails / notifications</span></label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox" name="c_needs" value="Integration" /><span>Connect to another system</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="form-row--split">
                <div class="form-row">
                  <label for="budget">Your budget</label>
                  <select id="budget" name="budget">
                    <option value="">Not sure yet</option>
                    <option>Under R1,000</option>
                    <option>R1,000–R2,500</option>
                    <option>R2,500–R5,000</option>
                    <option>R5,000–R10,000</option>
                    <option>R10,000+</option>
                  </select>
                  <span class="form__hint">Never rejects a project — it helps us right-size the solution.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <label for="deadline">When do you need it?</label>
                  <input type="text" id="deadline" name="deadline" placeholder="e.g. Within 2 weeks / no rush" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="form-row">
                <label class="file" for="attachment">
                  <span>Have something that explains the project? Upload it. <span class="optional">optional</span> — Excel, CSV, PDF, images, a logo, a spec</span>
                  <input type="file" id="attachment" name="attachment" multiple accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.gif,.webp,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.csv,.txt,.md,.zip" />
                  <span class="file__list" id="fileList"></span>
                </label>
                <span class="form__hint" id="fileHint">Up to 10 MB per file.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 3 — estimate + your details -->
            <div class="builder__step" data-step="3" hidden>
              <div class="builder__head">
                <h2>Your estimate</h2>
                <p>Based on what you've told us. The final fixed price is confirmed after we review.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="estimate">
                <span class="estimate__label">Estimated project</span>
                <span class="estimate__project" id="estProject">Your project</span>
                <span class="estimate__price" id="estPrice">Quoted after review</span>
                <span class="estimate__budget" id="estBudget" hidden></span>
                <span class="estimate__overbudget" id="estOver" hidden></span>
                <span class="estimate__note">This is an estimate, not a final quotation. We'll confirm the scope, fixed price and timeline before any development begins.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="builder__head" style="margin-top:0.4rem">
                <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem">Where do we send it?</h2>
              </div>
              <fieldset>
                <legend class="visually-hidden">Your details</legend>
                <div class="form-row--split">
                  <div class="form-row"><label for="name">Name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Your name" aria-describedby="nameError" /><span class="form__error" id="nameError">Please tell us your name.</span></div>
                  <div class="form-row"><label for="email">Email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" inputmode="email" aria-describedby="emailError" /><span class="form__error" id="emailError">Please enter a valid email so we can reply.</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row--split">
                  <div class="form-row"><label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="082 000 0000" inputmode="tel" /></div>
                  <div class="form-row"><label for="business">Business name <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="text" id="business" name="business" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your business" /></div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                  <span class="label">Best way to reach you</span>
                  <div class="choices qchips">
                    <label><input type="radio" name="contactPref" value="WhatsApp" checked /><span>WhatsApp</span></label>
                    <label><input type="radio" name="contactPref" value="Email" /><span>Email</span></label>
                    <label><input type="radio" name="contactPref" value="Phone call" /><span>Phone call</span></label>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <label class="hp" aria-hidden="true">Leave empty <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>

              <div class="deposit-box">
                <h3>Then a R500 deposit</h3>
                <p>Paid securely by card via Yoco <strong>after</strong> you submit. <strong>Fully refundable until you approve the quote</strong> — then it's credited to your project. <a class="inline-link" href="terms.html">Deposit terms</a>.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="mockup-offer">
                <div>
                  <strong>Not ready for a deposit?</strong>
                  <p class="small muted">Get a free, no-obligation mockup of your idea first — see it before you commit.</p>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-mockup-open>Get a free mockup</button>
              </div>
              <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden style="margin:-0.4rem 0 0">Prefer to talk before paying? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="email" hidden>Email us</a></p>
              <div class="form__submit">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--large btn--full" id="submitBtn">Submit project</button>
                <p class="form__privacy">Submitting sends your project to Re-Charge for review. We reply within one business day.</p>
                <div class="form__status form__status--error" id="formError" role="alert"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="builder__nav">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--back" id="backBtn" hidden>← Back</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="nextBtn">Next →</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="thanks" id="builderThanks" hidden tabindex="-1">
            <span class="thanks__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></span>
            <h2>We've got it.</h2>
            <p id="thanksBody">Your project's in. We'll review it and confirm the scope, fixed price and timeline — usually within one business day.</p>
            <p id="thanksPay" hidden class="small"></p>
            <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
              <a href="demos.html" class="btn btn--light">See what we build</a>
              <a href="index.html" class="btn btn--ghost-light">Back to home</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="enquiry__aside">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>How this works</h3>
            <ol>
              <li><strong>Describe it &amp; see a price</strong></li>
              <li><strong>Pay R500 to submit</strong></li>
              <li><strong>We confirm scope &amp; price</strong></li>
              <li><strong>We build &amp; launch</strong></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint" id="contactCard" hidden>
            <h3>Prefer to talk first?</h3>
            <p class="small">Book a quick call, or message us — no payment needed.</p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-call-open hidden>Schedule a call</button>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp</a>
              <a href="#" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-contact="email" hidden>Email</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint">
            <h3>See it before you commit</h3>
            <p class="small">Get a free, no-obligation mockup of your idea — no deposit. Love it, and we build it.</p>
            <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-mockup-open>Get a free mockup</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint">
            <h3>Rough price guide</h3>
            <ul class="checklist small">
              <li>Quick builds from R1,000</li>
              <li>Quick website R1,000</li>
              <li>Business website from R2,000</li>
              <li>Dashboards &amp; automation from R2,000</li>
              <li>AI from R3,500 · custom tools from R4,500</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.6rem">Every project gets a fixed quote before work begins. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing.html">Pricing details</a></p>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Schedule-a-call dialog -->
    <dialog class="callsched" id="callDialog" aria-labelledby="callTitle">
      <form class="callsched__form" id="callForm" novalidate>
        <div class="callsched__head">
          <h3 id="callTitle">Schedule a call</h3>
          <button type="button" class="callsched__x" data-call-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">Pick a day and a rough time and we'll call you to talk it through. No payment needed.</p>
        <div class="form-row">
          <span class="label">Day</span>
          <div class="choices" id="callDays" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose a day"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <span class="label">Time of day</span>
          <div class="choices" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose a time of day">
            <label><input type="radio" name="callTime" value="Morning (08:00–12:00)" /><span>Morning</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="callTime" value="Afternoon (12:00–16:00)" /><span>Afternoon</span></label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="callTime" value="Evening (16:00–18:30)" /><span>Evening</span></label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="callName">Your name</label><input type="text" id="callName" name="callName" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="callPhone">Phone number <span class="small muted">(so we can call you)</span></label><input type="tel" id="callPhone" name="callPhone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" required placeholder="082 000 0000" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="callEmail">Email <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="email" id="callEmail" name="callEmail" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="you@example.com" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="callNote">Anything we should know? <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="text" id="callNote" name="callNote" placeholder="e.g. What the project is about" /></div>
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
        <p class="callsched__error" id="callError" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" id="callSubmit">Request call</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-call-close>Cancel</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="callsched__done" id="callDone" hidden>
        <span class="thanks__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Call requested</h3>
        <p id="callDoneMsg" style="color:var(--text-muted)"></p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-call-close>Done</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <!-- Free-mockup dialog -->
    <dialog class="callsched" id="mockupDialog" aria-labelledby="mockupTitle">
      <form class="callsched__form" id="mockupForm" novalidate>
        <div class="callsched__head">
          <h3 id="mockupTitle">Get a free mockup</h3>
          <button type="button" class="callsched__x" data-mockup-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">Tell us a bit about it and we'll build a free preview so you can see your idea before deciding. No deposit, no obligation.</p>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkBusiness">Business or project name</label><input type="text" id="mkBusiness" name="mkBusiness" autocomplete="organization" required placeholder="e.g. Bella Hair Studio" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkAbout">What do you do, and who is it for?</label><textarea id="mkAbout" name="mkAbout" rows="2" required placeholder="e.g. A hair salon in Durban — customers book cuts and colours."></textarea></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkInclude">What should it include? <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="text" id="mkInclude" name="mkInclude" placeholder="e.g. Services, prices, gallery, WhatsApp booking" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkStyle">A site or style you like <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="text" id="mkStyle" name="mkStyle" placeholder="A link, or a few words on the look you want" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkEmail">Email</label><input type="email" id="mkEmail" name="mkEmail" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" /></div>
        <div class="form-row"><label for="mkPhone">Phone / WhatsApp <span class="optional">optional</span></label><input type="tel" id="mkPhone" name="mkPhone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="082 000 0000" /></div>
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0" />
        <p class="callsched__error" id="mockupError" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" id="mockupSubmit">Request my mockup</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-mockup-close>Cancel</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="callsched__done" id="mockupDone" hidden>
        <span class="thanks__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="26" height="26"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Mockup requested</h3>
        <p id="mockupDoneMsg" style="color:var(--text-muted)"></p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-mockup-close>Done</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>

  </main>
